# The build context is this module directory, and the image needs exactly one file out of it: the
# repackaged, layered jar. Narrowing it here does two jobs — it keeps target/classes, target/delombok
# and the test output from being uploaded to the daemon on every build, and it leaves `target/*.jar`
# in the Dockerfile matching one file rather than three, since the sources and javadoc jars sit in
# the same directory.
*
!target/*.jar
target/*-sources.jar
target/*-javadoc.jar
target/*.jar.original
